rgin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;2 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;OpenTelemetry for Balatro: a Steamodded mod exporting traces, logs and metrics, plus test tooling (unofficial)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Other Repositories (Pinned)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/svrnm/DemoMonkey&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DemoMonkey&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;30 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;12&lt;br&gt;Custom Demo Every Demo&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/svrnm/parallelGBC&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;parallelGBC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;26 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;7&lt;br&gt;Parallel Groebner Basis Computation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/svrnm/exceldatatables&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;exceldatatables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;29 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;18&lt;br&gt;Replace a worksheet within an Excel workbook (.xlsx) without changing any other properties of the file.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Hi there 👋&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I am Severin, Head of Community at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bronto.io/&quot;&gt;Bronto&lt;/a&gt;, a co-maintainer of the OpenTelemetry SIG Communications (&lt;a href=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/svrnm/svrnm/main/github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry.io&quot;&gt;Website and Docs&lt;/a&gt;) and the author of &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/svrnm/demomonkey&quot;&gt;DemoMonkey&lt;/a&gt;, a browser extension that helps to tailor custom demos.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in helping out with the OpenTelemetry SIG Communications, take a look at the issues labeled &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry.io/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3A%22help+wanted%22+&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;help wanted&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Many years ago I wrote my master thesis about parallel Gröbner basis computations. You can find the source code at &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/svrnm/parallelGBC&quot;&gt;svrnm/parallelGBC&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
